  "details": "In the strafing movement mode, the Look At Me camera will look directly at the player at all times.\nIn the Holoport movement mode, the player model and the player view desync. The camera will only face toward the player view, meaning the player model may move freely and not be tracked by the camera. When the player model stops moving again, the camera will jump its facing angle to the player's new position.\nThe Look At Me camera should track the player model, not the player view; or this should be an option.",
